# Build context for docker/runner/Dockerfile (the repository root): only global.json, the shared
# build/package props, the .NET sources under src/, the skills built into mbus (skills/) and the
# entry point and ACI bootstrap are used. Docker reads this file automatically; with Podman pass
# --ignorefile docker/runner/Dockerfile.dockerignore.
*
!global.json
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Build.targets
!Directory.Packages.props
!src/
!skills/
!docker/runner/entrypoint.sh
!docker/runner/aci-bootstrap.mjs
src/client/
**/bin/
**/obj/
